Voom includes a modified build of gvproxy from containers/gvisor-tap-vsock.

Upstream source: https://github.com/containers/gvisor-tap-vsock
Upstream revision: 9cfc86f66679ef0feed0f20ba1df558fe2bef5c6
Upstream version: v0.8.9

Voom adds private gateway forwarding and subnet blocking with exact IP and
port exceptions. It blocks guest access to host loopback services and fixes
UDP datagram forwarding and session cleanup. It also records the results of
host forwarding requests. The changes are in
nix/patches/gvproxy-gateway-forward.patch,
nix/patches/gvproxy-modification-notices.patch,
nix/patches/gvproxy-udp-forward.patch,
nix/patches/gvproxy-forward-outcomes.patch,
nix/patches/gvproxy-blocked-subnets.patch, and
nix/patches/gvproxy-mutation-outcomes.patch in the Voom source repository.

